      "created_at": "2021-02-02T21:57:44.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>We all know there are certain spirits that work well together:&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Heat of the Wildfire and Stone Unyeilding Defiance can stack up enough blight from the box on the blight card that you can keep the island healthy for a full game.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Finder of Paths Unseen and Ocean's Hungry Grasp can let you drown problematic cities in the center of the board.</p>\n<p>Spread of the Rampent Green (plus Vital Strength of the Earth) can help the Slumbering Serpent wake up much faster.</p>\n<p>So what are some of your favorite combos?&nbsp; What spirits play well together?</p>",
